# ADR 0010: Body weight tracking lives in the Core module

**Date:** 2026-08-02
**Status:** Accepted

## Context
Body weight is needed by both Training (progress tracking, PR 
bodyweight scaling) and Nutrition (TDEE calculation, trend for 
cut/bulk). It doesn't belong exclusively to either module.

## Decision
`BodyWeightEntry` and related services live in the Core module. 
Both Training and Nutrition read from the same source of truth.

## Alternatives considered
- **Duplicate in each module:** Would create sync problems and 
  double the HealthKit integration surface.
- **Nutrition owns it:** Nutrition is deferred; Training needs it 
  in v1.

## Consequences
- Nutrition module (when built) inherits body weight data with 
  zero migration.
- HealthKit body-mass integration lives in Core.

